    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<div class=\"video video-fit mb\" style=\"padding-top:56.25%;\"><p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"E-Recycling PDX 2021 - wwwE-RecyclingPDX.com\" width=\"1020\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/y3BUNDHqPIc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n</div>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #50b848\">Happy to announce the <strong>2nd Annual E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> at <a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://lexiconsolutions.com/\">Lexicon Solutions</a> this was a true success!  We received 5-6x the amount of usable electronic donations be refurbished and donated to:</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>                 <a href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\">RAPHAEL HOUSE</a>                   </strong><strong><a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\">NEW AVENUES FOR YOUTH</a>                           </strong><a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\"><strong>ROSEHAVEN</strong></a></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center\"> </h1>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1642 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/erecycling_logo_only.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"228\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/erecycling_logo_only.png 642w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/erecycling_logo_only-297x300.png 297w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/erecycling_logo_only-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 226px) 100vw, 226px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-size: 150%;color: #808080\">Both <strong><a style=\"color: #808080\" href=\"http://www.strategicitpro.com\">Strategic IT</a></strong> and <a style=\"color: #808080\" href=\"http://www.GetLagosNow.com\"><strong>Get Lagos Now</strong> </a>come together yearly to </span><span style=\"font-size: 150%;color: #808080\">host an the <strong>E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> with sponsoring companies and organizations, with the purpose of fulfilling a core passion &#8211; to help </span><span style=\"font-size: 150%;color: #808080\">give back to those in need through quality electronic donations.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://strategicitpro.com/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1515 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/compass.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"142\" /></a><a href=\"http://www.GetLagosNow.com\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1514\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln-300x76.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"76\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln-300x76.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln.png 330w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: #50b848\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 130%\">Donations Questions &#8211; Contact Michelle at <a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"mailto:Michelle@GetLagosNow.com\">Michelle@GetLagosNow.com</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2717 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Ben-and-jerrys-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"515\" height=\"343\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Ben-and-jerrys-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Ben-and-jerrys-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Ben-and-jerrys-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2711 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Energy-Trust-of-Oregon-PNG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"325\" height=\"155\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Energy-Trust-of-Oregon-PNG.png 325w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Energy-Trust-of-Oregon-PNG-300x143.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 325px) 100vw, 325px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2712 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"516\" height=\"345\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 516px) 100vw, 516px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2716 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donations-and-aileena-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"515\" height=\"344\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donations-and-aileena-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donations-and-aileena-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donations-and-aileena-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2728 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/destroying-hardrives.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"510\" height=\"339\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/destroying-hardrives.jpeg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/destroying-hardrives-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/destroying-hardrives-768x511.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px\" /></p>\n<h2><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2713 aligncenter\" src=\"ht