 /></h2>\n<h2><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2726 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dan-donates-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"493\" height=\"739\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dan-donates-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dan-donates-200x300.jpg 200w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dan-donates-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dan-donates-scaled.jpg 1707w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 493px) 100vw, 493px\" /></h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2724 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dave-and-gary-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dave-and-gary-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dave-and-gary-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Dave-and-gary-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2712 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"503\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/kim-speaks-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 503px) 100vw, 503px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2738 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/del-event-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"503\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/del-event-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/del-event-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/del-event-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/del-event-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/del-event-1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 503px) 100vw, 503px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2740 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Megan-2-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"494\" height=\"741\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Megan-2-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Megan-2-200x300.jpg 200w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Megan-2-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Megan-2-scaled.jpg 1707w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 494px) 100vw, 494px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2710 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"205\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png 597w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo-300x232.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 265px) 100vw, 265px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2737 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Tyrone-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"507\" height=\"339\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Tyrone-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Tyrone-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Tyrone-1-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 507px) 100vw, 507px\" /></p>\n<h2><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2739 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Steven-Quick-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"502\" height=\"335\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Steven-Quick-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Steven-Quick-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Steven-Quick-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 502px) 100vw, 502px\" /></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2736 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donating-the-heavy-stuff-1024x683.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"334\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donating-the-heavy-stuff-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donating-the-heavy-stuff-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/donating-the-heavy-stuff-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2714 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Michelle-speaks-1024x683.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"491\" height=\"328\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Michelle-speaks-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Michelle-speaks-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Michelle-speaks-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 491px) 100vw, 491px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2744 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/gary-speaks-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"487\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/gary-speaks-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/gary-speaks-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/gary-speaks-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 487px) 100vw, 487px\" /></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: #808080\"><strong>2021 Event SPEAKERS</strong></span></h2>\n<p>10:30am <strong> Allison Hancock &#8211; ED of Breast Friends</strong> will be speaking about Hope in the Breast Cancer journey and how<span style=\"color: #50b848\"><a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://breastfriends.org/\"><strong> Breast Friends</strong></a> </span>gives that hope.</p>\n<p>11am <strong>Michelle Lagos &#8211; Managing CEO of <span style=\"color: #50b848\"><a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"http://www.GetLagosNow.com\">Get Lagos Now</a>/</span>Co-Founder of the E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> will be speaking about important ways to Be Found in the digital world and stay cyber safe.</p>\n<p>11:30am <strong>Megan Owen &#8211;  Business Development Associate at<span style=\"color: #50b848\"><a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\"> Rose Haven </a></span></strong>will be speaking on the role technology with play in the new space in 2022.</p>\n<p>12:00p T<strong>yrone Henry &#8211; Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Lead at Energy Trust of Oregon</strong>, and a co-presenter will provide information on <span style=\"color: #50b848\"><strong><a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://www.energytrust.org/\">Energy Trust</a></strong></span> programs and services for households and businesses.</p>\n<p>12:30p <strong>Amanda Ives &#8211; Development Director of<span style=\"color: #50b848\"><a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\"> Raphael House</a></span></strong> will be speaking on the ways Raphael House helps domestic abuse survivors and their families find safety, hope, and independence.</p>\n<p>1pm <strong>Kim Higley &#8211; Business Career Coordinator at <span style=\"color: #50b848\"><a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://newavenues.org/\">New Avenues for Youth </a></span></strong>will be speaking on New Avenues for Youth&#8217;s Mission and Support Services.</p>\n<p>1:30p <strong>Steve Quick &#8211; Owner of <span style=\"color: #50b848\"><a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://sqmerchantservices.com/\">SQ Merchant Services</a></span></strong> with be speaking on the best ways to dispose of your Visa equipment and other general biz info.</p>\n<p>2p <strong>Gary Dunsworth &#8211; Owner of<span style=\"color: #50b848\"> <a style=\"color: #50b848\" href=\"https://strategicitpro.com/\">Strategic IT</a>/</span>Co-Founder of the E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> will be speaking on the difference between Managed Services and Break &amp; Fix Services, and how each are appropriate for different organizations.</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DONATION UPDATE </strong></h1>\n<p>Gary &amp; I would like to again thank everyone for their support this year.  We&#8217;re happy to announce that today <a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://newavenues.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1641970828269000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ycEvU1KpVwC3yR6N-UXCx\">New Avenues for Youth</a>  and <a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rosehaven.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1641970828269000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07V0jr-SSR4FenOtDXW13d\">Rose Haven</a> received 6 refurbished laptops, many with new cords, one I-phone, and a Samsung tablet on December 21st.</p>\n<p>Katie O&#8217;brien, ED from <strong><a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rosehaven</a></strong> has confirmed that they will be taking the refurbished laptops and using them amongst staff, as they prepare for the NEW location opening in March this year. They received a total of 3 new laptops and 6 new desktopns</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\"><strong>New Avenues for Youth</strong></a> will be giving their electronic donations  to youth in current programs that are in need. This year they received a total of 3 laptops and 2 All-In-One Desktops</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #800080\"><strong><a href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\">Raphael House</a> </strong><span style=\"color: #282828\">received a total of 3 new laptops.</span></span></p>\n<div>Thank you for your continued support!  We&#8217;ll keep you updated as the next round is donated and plans for the up and coming <strong>2022 Recycling Event</strong> is created.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-3038 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/new-avenues-12.21-donation-rotated.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"517\" height=\"689\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/new-avenues-12.21-donation-rotated.jpg 480w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/new-avenues-12.21-donation-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 517px) 100vw, 517px\" /></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sean Suib, Executive Director of New Avenues for Youth and Michelle Lagos on December 21, 2021. </strong></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-3039 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/rosehaven-12.21-donation-rotated.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"701\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/rosehaven-12.21-donation-rotated.jpg 480w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/rosehaven-12.21-donation-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 526px) 100vw, 526px\" /></div>\n<div> </div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Katie O&#8217;Brien, Executive Director of Rose Haven and Michelle Lagos on December 21, 2021.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3075\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Rahp-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"491\" height=\"614\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Rahp-1.jpeg 512w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Rahp-1-240x300.jpeg 240w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 491px) 100vw, 491px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Michelle making refurbished Dell laptop donations to Raphael House &#8211; Development Director. Amanda Ives, Grebner on Feb. 9, 2022.</strong>.  <a href=\"https://justicia4migrantworkers.org/profile/ohgirl\" target=\"_blank\">Omgitsher one piece</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3077\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/rosehaven-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"513\" height=\"638\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/rosehaven-1.jpg 514w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/rosehaven-1-241x300.jpg 241w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 513px) 100vw, 513px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Refurbished All-In-One laptop donations to Rosehaven &#8211;  Volunteer Kathy on Feb. 9, 2022.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3078\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/be-the-change.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"476\" height=\"634\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/be-the-change.jpg 720w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/be-the-change-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 476px) 100vw, 476px\" /></p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
